sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Utilisateur / Vérificateur
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend (Flask)
    participant D as SQLite DB

    U->>F: Saisit ID ou hash du certificat
    F->>B: GET /certificates/verify/{id_or_hash}
    B->>D: SELECT * FROM certificates WHERE id=? OR blockchain_hash=?
    D-->>B: Résultat

    alt Certificat trouvé
        B->>D: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action='VERIFY', ...)
        B-->>F: 200 OK {certificate, status}
        F->>U: Affiche les détails (nom, programme, statut, hash blockchain)
    else Non trouvé
        B-->>F: 404 Not Found
        F->>U: "Certificat introuvable"
    end
